    <!-- Mirror of Strings.zh-Hant.xaml in Russian. Same keys, same {0} placeholders in the same
         meaning — StringsParityTests fails the build if the dictionaries drift apart.

         Written as Russian software rather than as a translation of the English: buttons are verbs
         in the infinitive (Сохранить, Закрыть), tooltips say what the control does, quotes are «».
         Feature names are fixed — Перевод снимка экрана, Всплывающий перевод, Перевод с заменой,
         Перевод в реальном времени, Перевод текста, плавающая панель — and a screen that invents its
         own wording for one of them is the thing to catch in review.

         Russian runs longer than English, and field labels sit in a shared-width column that sizes
         itself to the longest one: prefer the noun over the sentence. -->

